window.KOW_HELP_HTML_EN = "\n<div class=\"notice\"><b>Recommended workflow:</b> Officer → Stars → Development → XP → Planner, then use <b>Save Progress</b>. Use <b>Backup & Restore</b> in Settings before major changes or when moving data between devices.</div>\n<h3>✨ What’s New — v4.3.35 LIVE</h3>\n<p><b>Legendary, Epic and Elite are now fully supported as separate Officer rarities.</b> Development, Stars, Universal Badges, Training totals and Progress calculations follow the selected Officer rarity.</p>\n<h3>1. Officer</h3>\n<p>Use Search Officer, Season, Rarity and Role to select an Officer. Officer names and game data are not translated. Each Officer keeps an individual saved progress profile while shared resource inventories remain populated when you switch Officers.</p>\n<p>Version 4.3.35 includes the additional Epic Officers Dorothea, Abigail, Monica, Linda, Riven, Maria, Evelyn and Helena, plus Elite Officers Marjorie and Jeanne. Their portraits and roles are included.</p>\n<h3>2. Stars</h3>\n<p>The Stars tab follows Officer rarity. Legendary, Epic and Elite each use their own Star I / II / III inventory. Star Readiness Vouchers (SRV) are Legendary-only and are not used by Epic or Elite Officers.</p>\n<h3>3. Development</h3>\n<p>Skill Strands unlock by Current Star Level: 0★ = Strand 1, 1★ = Strands 1–2, 2★ = Strands 1–3, and 3★+ = all four strands. Level 1 is free when a strand becomes available.</p>\n<p><b>Legendary:</b> Unlock 10 + Promotion 690 + Training 5 × 180 = 900 → <b>1,600 badges total.</b></p>\n<p><b>Epic:</b> Unlock 10 + Promotion 440 + Training 25 × 180 = 4,500 → <b>4,950 badges total.</b></p>\n<p><b>Elite:</b> Unlock 10 + Promotion 440 + Training 100 × 180 = 18,000 → <b>18,450 badges total.</b></p>\n<p>Epic and Elite Promotion sequence: 10, 10, 15, 15, 20, 20, 25, 25, 30, 30, 35, 35, 40, 40, 45, 45 = 440.</p>\n<p>The Develop page refreshes rarity information every time the selected Officer changes, so Epic, Elite and Legendary values cannot carry over from the previous Officer.</p>\n<h3>4. Progress</h3>\n<p>Progress shows MAXED, IN PROGRESS or NOT STARTED. A MAX Officer is 5★, Level 70, unlocked, all four Skill Strands at Level 5 and Training 180. Version 4.3.35 keeps Home and Progress reporting consistent.</p>\n<h3>5. XP</h3>\n<p>Enter current and target Officer Level and the number of XP Books held. The app calculates XP held, XP required and XP shortfall.</p>\n<h3>6. Planner</h3>\n<p>Use Planner after Stars, Development and XP. Goals include Max Officer, Next Star, Reach 5★, Max Skills and Max Training. The Resource Optimiser is preview-only and does not spend resources.</p>\n<h3>7. Database & Releases</h3>\n<p>The Database contains the Officer master list. Releases shows the recurring annual release calendar and future Officer cost forecast.</p>\n<h3>8. Settings, Language, Backup & Restore</h3>\n<p>Select English, Français, Deutsch or Italiano. Your language choice is saved on this device. Reset App returns the language to English.</p>\n<p>Export App Backup creates a portable JSON backup of locally saved KoW Companion data. Restore App Backup reloads a previous backup, including Officer-specific progress and shared resource inventories.</p>\n<h3>9. Version</h3>\n<p>This multilingual build is <b>v4.3.35</b>. The Settings Version Integrity check should report v4.3.35 consistently.</p>\n";
